-- HAND-EDITED (3): GiST exclusion constraint on provision_version.
-- Drizzle pg-core cannot express EXCLUDE USING gist constraints.
-- Guarantees no two provision_version rows for the same provision_id may have
-- overlapping valid_range values — exactly one result for any (provision_id, date)
-- point-in-time query:
--   SELECT text FROM provision_version
--   WHERE provision_id = $1 AND valid_range @> $2::date
